    {
      "category": "curriculum",
      "field": "course_content",
      "value": "Courses in this program run the gamut from justice theories to social inquiry. You’ll explore legal and social philosophies of justice while learning new methods for conducting justice studies research. You can also take a range of electives, such as justice-seeking organizations, ethnic studies and disability rights.",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "source": {
        "source_type": "program",
        "url": ""
      },
      "metadata": {
