      }
    },
    {
      "category": "career",
      "field": "career_opportunities",
      "value": "As a graduate of this program, you’ll have a diverse range of job opportunities available to you to pursue a justice studies career. You’ll be prepared for jobs in law, government, politics, education, community-based works and more.",
